    "body": "## What\n\nMerge upstream v18.4.4 into the fork, retaining runtime version preparation, CI checks, paused-task behavior, and terminal focus handling.\n\n## Why\n\nBring the source fork up to the latest upstream release without restoring the retired permissions rework.\n\n## Testing\n\n- Staged merge diff passed whitespace checks.\n- Merged before the validation gate passed, at the user's request.\n- Source CI #58 and #59 failed formatting checks in three merge-resolved files.\n- Arch build #146 built the native addon successfully but failed bundling the CLI because the generated native archive could not be resolved. It did not publish a package.\n- Follow-up fixes are in progress; this merge is not a passing validation gate.\n- TS/Rust suites and worker smoke tests remain disabled under the temporary CI policy. Local compilation was not performed.\n- Changelog additions were not requested; upstream release entries are preserved.\n\n---\n\n- [ ] `bun check` passes\n- [ ] Tested locally\n- [ ] CHANGELOG updated with the required attribution (if user-facing; internal issue fixes use issue links, external contributions add the PR link and contributor credit after creation)",
